// ⚠️ THIS NOTE IS AT THE FILE END ON PURPOSE. A comment ABOVE the music shifts every
// source offset after it, so the whole book's data-pos moves and its snapshot has to be
// re-based -- a diff that proves nothing and hides the next real one. Below the music,
// nothing moves (measured: suite green with these notes, 10 snapshots red without).
// ✔ VERIFIED TO GUARD, not assumed to (session 190) — the BEAMING half: skipping the beamExceptions lookup in AutoBeamCheck.EndsBeam moves this book. ⚠️ The BRACKET-SIDE half is still unmeasured: Staff.IsMultiVoice (the "multi-voice => bracket up" input, 3 live call sites) forced to false moves 0 of 566 git-tracked books, so whatever puts the bracket below here, it is not that.
